	(text "Stage2: autonomous limited AON paths; main admissions still absent.\nUSB UVLO is tied directly to IN to allow initial5V, not factory15V.\nSHDN self-biased open; MODE=localRTN gives active limit/auto-retry.\nAll three RTN/EP domains remain separate from GND and one another.\nNative reverse-blocking OR replaces Schottky; leakage/transients need tests.\nRILIM118k/1% stays below120k recommendation; short limit ~123mA max.\nCin100nF each; shared switched AON input has10uF+100nF on supply sheet.\nReduced AON0.200W target /0.250W ceiling; CAN standby until full profile.\nSource connector, PD, coordinated entry fuse/TVS and flight inhibit are boundaries.\nInputs provisional<=24V fault envelope; no60V system rating claimed.\nCold attach, slow ramp with VIN-enabled buck, restart/leakage remain scope gates."
		(at 20.32 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c9f89fef-86fb-487c-bd68-358c7e8c77a8")
	)
